---
layout: base.njk
title: Music
description: Music by Joshua Hamsa, with recorded songs and AI-made songs in separate sections.
section: music
permalink: /music/
---
<h1>Music</h1>

<h2>Recorded</h2>
<p>Music I&rsquo;ve recorded, most of it under the name MC Hamsa.</p>
<iframe class="audio" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/{{ music.spotifyArtist }}" title="MC Hamsa on Spotify" height="352" loading="lazy" allow="encrypted-media; fullscreen"></iframe>
<p><a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/{{ music.spotifyArtist }}">Listen on Spotify</a></p>
{% for song in music.recorded %}
<h3>{{ song.title }}</h3>
<p class="meta">{{ song.note }}</p>
{% video song %}
<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v={{ song.videoId }}">Watch on YouTube</a></p>
{% endfor %}

<h2>Made with AI</h2>
<p>These songs were made with AI, using Suno.</p>
<h3>{{ music.ai.featured.title }}</h3>
<iframe class="audio" src="https://suno.com/embed/{{ music.ai.featured.id }}" title="{{ music.ai.featured.title }} on Suno" height="240" loading="lazy"></iframe>
<p><a href="https://suno.com/song/{{ music.ai.featured.id }}">Listen on Suno</a></p>
<h3>Playlists</h3>
<ul>
{% for list in music.ai.playlists %}  <li><a href="https://suno.com/playlist/{{ list.id }}">{{ list.title }}</a></li>
{% endfor %}</ul>
<p><a href="{{ music.ai.profile }}">All of my songs on Suno</a></p>
